= entry .Weekdays   a choice of weekday names: how a `Weekday` is shown
-   detail
+   detail

-       A `Weekdays` maps each `Weekday` to its name, the context `Weekday.showable` needs and
-       the `Rrule` descriptions use. None is in implicit scope: one is imported by name from the
-       `weekdays` package — `englishWeekdays` (`Monday`), `englishShortWeekdays` (`Mon`),
-       `twoLetterWeekdays` (`Mo`), `oneLetterAmbiguousWeekdays` (`M`, `T`, `W`, `T`, …),
-       `shortestUnambiguousWeekdays` (`M`, `Tu`, `W`, `Th`, …), `frenchWeekdays`,
-       `germanWeekdays` or `spanishWeekdays` — or written as a lambda, since the trait has the
-       single method `#name`.
+       Un `Weekdays` associa ogni `Weekday` al suo nome, il contesto di cui ha bisogno
+       `Weekday.showable` e che usano le descrizioni di `Rrule`. Nessuno si trova nell'ambito
+       implicito: se ne importa uno per nome dal package `weekdays` — `englishWeekdays` (`Monday`),
+       `englishShortWeekdays` (`Mon`), `twoLetterWeekdays` (`Mo`), `oneLetterAmbiguousWeekdays`
+       (`M`, `T`, `W`, `T`, …), `shortestUnambiguousWeekdays` (`M`, `Tu`, `W`, `Th`, …),
+       `frenchWeekdays`, `germanWeekdays` o `spanishWeekdays` — oppure lo si scrive come lambda,
+       poiché il trait ha il solo metodo `#name`.

=       single method `#name`.
=
